[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to another great lesson with EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.1400000000000003, "end": 6.16}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 6.42, "end": 7.12}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you another great lesson about being at the bank.", "start": 7.48, "end": 11.34}, {"text": "That's right. We've got an intermediate lesson for you today with lots of great language to help you open a bank account.", "start": 11.54, "end": 18.74}, {"text": "Okay, so let's look at our vocabulary preview today.", "start": 19.04, "end": 21.84}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 22.98, "end": 24.18}, {"text": "Two words today. The first one is checking account.", "start": 24.66, "end": 29.32}, {"text": "A checking account.", "start": 29.32, "end": 30.54}, {"text": "Checking account.", "start": 30.68, "end": 31.56}, {"text": "So what is a checking account?", "start": 32.279999999999994, "end": 34.94}, {"text": "Well, it's a type of bank account that lets you do your day-to-day or daily banking.", "start": 35.24, "end": 40.98}, {"text": "So it's the normal bank account that you use to go shopping, that you use to pay your bills.", "start": 41.06, "end": 45.52}, {"text": "Yep, exactly.", "start": 45.8, "end": 46.52}, {"text": "The opposite. And our second word is...", "start": 46.78, "end": 49.4}, {"text": "Savings account.", "start": 49.4, "end": 50.54}, {"text": "A savings account.", "start": 50.7, "end": 51.86}, {"text": "Savings account.", "start": 51.98, "end": 52.96}, {"text": "So a savings account is to...", "start": 53.34, "end": 55.52}, {"text": "It's a bank account where you save your money.", "start": 55.52, "end": 57.46}, {"text": "To save money, right?", "start": 57.66, "end": 58.74}, {"text": "So usually you don't touch the money in this account.", "start": 58.74, "end": 61.22}, {"text": "Yeah, usually it stays in there.", "start": 61.4, "end": 63.2}, {"text": "Right, so usually banks will have these two types of accounts.", "start": 63.62, "end": 67.02}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 67.18, "end": 67.34}, {"text": "Checking and savings.", "start": 67.5, "end": 68.36}, {"text": "Okay, great. Let's listen to our dialogue a first time now.", "start": 68.94, "end": 71.68}, {"text": "Right, well today we're at a bank and we're going to listen as a man is opening a bank account.", "start": 71.9, "end": 76.42}, {"text": "The dialogue is going to be spoken at a normal speed, so it might be a little bit fast.", "start": 76.68, "end": 81.12}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 81.2, "end": 81.42}, {"text": "But don't worry about it because we'll come back and explain everything.", "start": 81.42, "end": 84.82}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 85.04, "end": 85.16}, {"text": "Next please. May I help you, sir?", "start": 94.0, "end": 95.96}, {"text": "Hello. Yes. I'd like to open a bank account.", "start": 97.38, "end": 100.14}, {"text": "Certainly. I can help you with that.", "start": 101.16, "end": 102.78}, {"text": "What type of account would you like to open?", "start": 103.06, "end": 105.06}, {"text": "A checking or a saving account?", "start": 105.24, "end": 106.76}, {"text": "What features do they offer?", "start": 106.76, "end": 108.34}, {"text": "Well, if you just take a look here, see, with our checking account, you can have unlimited daily transactions for a small monthly fee.", "start": 108.8, "end": 115.66}, {"text": "And our savings account has a higher interest rate.", "start": 116.04, "end": 118.54}, {"text": "But you must carry a minimum balance of $10,000.", "start": 118.72, "end": 121.62}, {"text": "I see. Well, I think I'm more interested in a checking account.", "start": 122.32, "end": 126.24}, {"text": "I'd like to have easy access to my money.", "start": 126.6, "end": 128.66}, {"text": "All right, then. With this checking account, you'll be issued a debit card and a checkbook.", "start": 129.67999999999998, "end": 134.42}, {"text": "Will you require overdraft protection?", "start": 134.86, "end": 137.06}, {"text": "There is an extra fee for that.", "start": 137.46, "end": 139.12}, {"text": "No, that won't be necessary.", "start": 139.42, "end": 140.64}, {"text": "In that case, I'll get you to fill out this paperwork.", "start": 141.52, "end": 144.46}, {"text": "I'll need your social insurance number and two pieces of government ID.", "start": 144.78, "end": 148.2}, {"text": "If you could just sign here, and here, and here, we'll be all set.", "start": 152.98000000000002, "end": 158.28}, {"text": "Would you like to make a deposit today?", "start": 158.66, "end": 160.42}, {"text": "Yes, I'd like to deposit one billion dollars.", "start": 161.2, "end": 164.24}, {"text": "Ha ha ha ha!", "start": 164.62, "end": 165.72}, {"text": "Ha ha ha ha!", "start": 166.68, "end": 168.44}, {"text": "One billion dollars!", "start": 169.54, "end": 170.96}, {"text": "Ha ha ha ha!", "start": 171.3, "end": 172.28}, {"text": "Ha ha ha ha!", "start": 172.86, "end": 174.42}, {"text": "One billion!", "start": 174.44, "end": 175.16}, {"text": "Hmm.", "start": 175.72, "end": 176.0}, {"text": "All right, one billion dollars.", "start": 180.48, "end": 182.7}, {"text": "That's a lot of money.", "start": 183.24, "end": 184.02}, {"text": "That's a weird laugh.", "start": 184.2, "end": 185.3}, {"text": "Ha ha ha ha!", "start": 185.5, "end": 186.88}, {"text": "Okay, let's look at language takeaway today.", "start": 187.26, "end": 189.96}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 191.51999999999998, "end": 192.56}, {"text": "Today, we've got four words for you in language takeaway all about money and banking.", "start": 193.94, "end": 198.86}, {"text": "Money and banking.", "start": 199.1, "end": 199.8}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 199.9, "end": 200.1}, {"text": "The first one that we have today is transaction.", "start": 200.26, "end": 203.04}, {"text": "Transaction.", "start": 203.82, "end": 204.34}, {"text": "Transaction.", "start": 205.04, "end": 205.56}, {"text": "Uh, transaction.", "start": 205.72, "end": 206.62}, {"text": "Transaction.", "start": 206.62, "end": 207.02}, {"text": "So we have some great examples that will help you understand what a transaction is.", "start": 207.56, "end": 212.18}, {"text": "So let's listen.", "start": 212.58, "end": 213.38}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 214.78, "end": 215.76}, {"text": "", "start": 215.78, "end": 215.78}, {"text": "I need a record of my most recent bank transactions.", "start": 217.9, "end": 220.7}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 224.5, "end": 225.4}, {"text": "There is no fee for bank transactions done online.", "start": 229.06, "end": 231.98}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 236.08, "end": 237.04}, {"text": "Okay, we've deposited your money.", "start": 240.4, "end": 242.34}, {"text": "Would you like to make another transaction today?", "start": 242.5, "end": 244.3}, {"text": "So basically, I can understand that a transaction is moving money around in your bank account.", "start": 247.12, "end": 253.44}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 253.7, "end": 254.14}, {"text": "It's taking your money from...", "start": 254.26, "end": 255.98}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 255.98, "end": 256.42}, {"text": "It's taking money from your bank account and putting it in another account or just taking it to spend.", "start": 256.44, "end": 261.96}, {"text": "Whatever.", "start": 262.26, "end": 262.34}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 262.62, "end": 262.86}, {"text": "That's a transaction.", "start": 262.86, "end": 263.76}, {"text": "Or even putting money into your bank account.", "start": 263.98, "end": 266.06}, {"text": "That's also a transaction.", "start": 266.16, "end": 267.0}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 267.84, "end": 268.16}, {"text": "Our second word.", "start": 268.42, "end": 269.48}, {"text": "Balance.", "start": 269.82, "end": 270.38}, {"text": "Balance.", "start": 270.82, "end": 271.38}, {"text": "Balance.", "start": 271.96, "end": 272.52}, {"text": "Balance.", "start": 272.82, "end": 273.14}, {"text": "Your account balance is how much money you have.", "start": 273.92, "end": 277.7}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 277.86, "end": 278.22}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 278.54, "end": 278.8}, {"text": "An account balance.", "start": 278.94, "end": 279.74}, {"text": "My account balance is $2 right now, I think.", "start": 280.04, "end": 283.26}, {"text": "That's a bit of a problem.", "start": 283.6, "end": 284.86}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 285.14, "end": 285.54}, {"text": "Good thing payday is three days away.", "start": 285.8, "end": 287.32}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 287.74, "end": 287.78}, {"text": "Oh my God.", "start": 287.96, "end": 288.38}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 288.38, "end": 289.12}, {"text": "Our third word, overdraft.", "start": 289.66, "end": 292.16}, {"text": "Overdraft.", "start": 292.94, "end": 293.46}, {"text": "Overdraft.", "start": 294.14000000000004, "end": 294.66}, {"text": "Overdraft.", "start": 295.06, "end": 295.58}, {"text": "So this really comes in handy, right?", "start": 296.1, "end": 298.44}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 298.6, "end": 298.74}, {"text": "To overdraft, can you tell us a little bit about it?", "start": 299.12, "end": 301.58}, {"text": "Let's say in my bank account, I have $500.", "start": 301.86, "end": 304.3}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 304.84, "end": 305.1}, {"text": "But I spend $600.", "start": 305.28, "end": 307.06}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 307.62, "end": 307.92}, {"text": "So I have an overdraft in my account, meaning I owe the bank $100.", "start": 308.2, "end": 313.52}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 314.24, "end": 314.74}, {"text": "It's also commonly referred to as a negative balance.", "start": 314.74, "end": 318.02}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 318.22, "end": 318.66}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 318.86, "end": 318.98}, {"text": "Negative balance.", "start": 319.08, "end": 319.7}, {"text": "Like me.", "start": 320.54, "end": 321.26}, {"text": "Very soon, I will have a negative balance.", "start": 321.46, "end": 323.78}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 324.04, "end": 324.3}, {"text": "I think this one is a little bit tricky to understand.", "start": 324.36, "end": 326.48}, {"text": "So let's listen to a couple of examples of how we use this word.", "start": 326.48, "end": 329.94}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 331.1, "end": 331.94}, {"text": "The maximum overdraft on my account is only $5,000.", "start": 334.32, "end": 337.54}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 342.08, "end": 342.86}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 346.44, "end": 347.04}, {"text": "I'm sorry, sir, but you've exceeded your maximum overdraft limit.", "start": 347.04, "end": 350.02}, {"text": "I cannot give you any more money.", "start": 350.3, "end": 351.64}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 356.56, "end": 357.54}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 361.94, "end": 362.86}, {"text": "I have to pay $1,500 in overdraft fees.", "start": 363.18, "end": 366.18}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 370.5, "end": 371.06}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 371.26, "end": 371.3}, {"text": "Great examples.", "start": 371.3, "end": 371.76}, {"text": "Now we can take a look at our last word.", "start": 371.96, "end": 373.5}, {"text": "Debit card.", "start": 373.8, "end": 374.74}, {"text": "Debit card.", "start": 374.98, "end": 375.8}, {"text": "Debit card.", "start": 376.2, "end": 377.22}, {"text": "D-E-B-I-T.", "start": 377.44, "end": 379.08}, {"text": "Card.", "start": 379.32, "end": 379.62}, {"text": "Debit card.", "start": 379.82, "end": 380.46}, {"text": "So a debit card is issued by the bank.", "start": 380.86, "end": 383.0}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 383.14, "end": 383.38}, {"text": "And used to?", "start": 383.68, "end": 384.76}, {"text": "Take money out of an ATM.", "start": 384.98, "end": 387.2}, {"text": "From an ATM machine, right?", "start": 387.62, "end": 389.12}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 389.36, "end": 389.56}, {"text": "A debit card.", "start": 389.68, "end": 390.44}, {"text": "Not to be confused with a credit card.", "start": 390.62, "end": 392.7}, {"text": "Not the same thing.", "start": 392.72, "end": 393.54}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 393.54, "end": 394.12}, {"text": "Okay, great.", "start": 394.62, "end": 395.5}, {"text": "So now we could listen to our dialogue a second time at a slower speed.", "start": 395.7, "end": 400.06}, {"text": "So now we can...", "start": 400.06, "end": 401.14}, {"text": "We can hear all of the great language you just talked about.", "start": 401.14, "end": 403.54}, {"text": "Next, please.", "start": 415.2, "end": 416.2}, {"text": "May I help you, sir?", "start": 416.6, "end": 417.78}, {"text": "Hello.", "start": 418.16, "end": 418.76}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 419.04, "end": 419.44}, {"text": "I'd like to open a bank account.", "start": 419.68, "end": 421.88}, {"text": "Certainly.", "start": 422.54, "end": 423.14}, {"text": "I can help you with that.", "start": 423.36, "end": 425.0}, {"text": "What type of account would you like to open?", "start": 425.48, "end": 428.12}, {"text": "A checking or a savings account?", "start": 428.32, "end": 430.36}, {"text": "What features do they offer?", "start": 431.1, "end": 433.0}, {"text": "Well, if you just look here...", "start": 433.54, "end": 435.84}, {"text": "See, with our checking account, you can have unlimited daily transactions for a small monthly fee.", "start": 435.84, "end": 442.94}, {"text": "And our savings account has a higher interest rate.", "start": 443.18, "end": 447.0}, {"text": "But you must carry a minimum balance of $10,000.", "start": 447.78000000000003, "end": 451.48}, {"text": "I see.", "start": 452.68, "end": 453.94}, {"text": "Well, I think I'm more interested in a checking account.", "start": 454.32, "end": 458.0}, {"text": "I like to have easy access to my money.", "start": 458.0, "end": 461.32}, {"text": "All right, then.", "start": 462.32, "end": 463.22}, {"text": "With this checking account, you'll be issued with a debit card and a checkbook.", "start": 463.64, "end": 468.88}, {"text": "Will you require overdraft protection?", "start": 469.34, "end": 471.54}, {"text": "There is an extra fee for that.", "start": 471.94, "end": 474.08}, {"text": "No, that won't be necessary.", "start": 474.08, "end": 476.38}, {"text": "In that case, I'll get you to fill out this paperwork.", "start": 477.32, "end": 481.26}, {"text": "I'll need your social insurance number and two pieces of government ID.", "start": 481.76, "end": 486.6}, {"text": "If you could just sign here and here and here, we'll be all set.", "start": 487.84000000000003, "end": 494.58}, {"text": "Would you like to make a deposit today?", "start": 495.06, "end": 497.12}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 497.62, "end": 498.36}, {"text": "I'd like to deposit $1 billion.", "start": 498.58, "end": 500.6}, {"text": "We heard some interesting phrases of how to tell somebody to do something in a polite way.", "start": 509.28, "end": 514.54}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 514.72, "end": 515.08}, {"text": "So, let's start with Fluency Builder and explain these words.", "start": 515.38, "end": 518.56}, {"text": "Fluency Builder", "start": 519.72, "end": 520.86}, {"text": "The bank teller asked this man to do a number of things in order to open his bank account.", "start": 520.86, "end": 526.68}, {"text": "And she used some great expressions.", "start": 526.68, "end": 529.04}, {"text": "Right. Let's listen to how she asked the man to do some things in a polite way.", "start": 529.04, "end": 534.94}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 535.04, "end": 535.26}, {"text": "I'll get you to fill out this paperwork.", "start": 535.9, "end": 538.68}, {"text": "I'll get you to fill out this paperwork.", "start": 539.98, "end": 542.82}, {"text": "I'll need your social insurance number.", "start": 545.08, "end": 547.44}, {"text": "I'll need your social insurance number.", "start": 549.22, "end": 551.58}, {"text": "If you could just sign here.", "start": 553.26, "end": 555.24}, {"text": "If you could just sign here.", "start": 557.26, "end": 559.02}, {"text": "So, the first thing she said is, I'll get you to fill out this paperwork.", "start": 560.46, "end": 564.88}, {"text": "I'll get you to.", "start": 565.34, "end": 566.58}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 566.96, "end": 567.36}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 567.72, "end": 568.16}, {"text": "I'll get you to.", "start": 568.28, "end": 569.1}, {"text": "So, it's just a way of saying, can you please fill this out?", "start": 570.06, "end": 573.4}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 573.6, "end": 573.78}, {"text": "Do this.", "start": 573.92, "end": 574.44}, {"text": "Do this.", "start": 574.6, "end": 574.98}, {"text": "But in a different way.", "start": 574.98, "end": 575.92}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 576.02, "end": 576.28}, {"text": "More polite.", "start": 576.54, "end": 577.14}, {"text": "It's pretty polite.", "start": 577.42, "end": 578.1}, {"text": "Then she also said, I'll need your social insurance number.", "start": 578.9200000000001, "end": 583.08}, {"text": "I'll need your.", "start": 583.28, "end": 584.2}, {"text": "I'll need your.", "start": 584.48, "end": 585.6}, {"text": "Again, a polite way of saying.", "start": 586.1, "end": 587.92}, {"text": "Give me.", "start": 588.18, "end": 588.74}, {"text": "Give me.", "start": 588.9, "end": 589.36}, {"text": "Your social insurance number.", "start": 589.48, "end": 590.28}, {"text": "Give me your social insurance number.", "start": 590.58, "end": 591.92}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 591.94, "end": 592.06}, {"text": "And the last thing she said, and this is really polite.", "start": 592.48, "end": 595.22}, {"text": "If you could just sign here.", "start": 595.42, "end": 596.98}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 597.7, "end": 598.1}, {"text": "If you could just sign here.", "start": 598.6999999999999, "end": 600.08}, {"text": "If you could just.", "start": 600.2, "end": 601.1}, {"text": "If you could just wait a moment.", "start": 601.62, "end": 603.26}, {"text": "I'll be with you.", "start": 603.48, "end": 604.46}, {"text": "If you could just send me an email with your bank account number.", "start": 604.78, "end": 607.82}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 608.32, "end": 608.64}, {"text": "Very polite way of asking for something.", "start": 609.0, "end": 610.74}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 610.88, "end": 610.98}, {"text": "Well, some great language in today's cast.", "start": 611.58, "end": 613.7}, {"text": "Let's listen to the dialogue one last time and we'll catch all of this wonderful language.", "start": 613.78, "end": 618.72}, {"text": "Next, please.", "start": 627.76, "end": 628.54}, {"text": "May I help you, sir?", "start": 628.92, "end": 629.78}, {"text": "Hello.", "start": 630.92, "end": 631.26}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 631.68, "end": 632.04}, {"text": "I'd like to open a bank account.", "start": 632.42, "end": 633.96}, {"text": "Certainly.", "start": 634.6, "end": 635.08}, {"text": "I can help you with that.", "start": 635.4, "end": 636.6}, {"text": "What type of account would you like to open?", "start": 636.9, "end": 638.88}, {"text": "A checking or a saving account?", "start": 639.12, "end": 640.58}, {"text": "What features do they offer?", "start": 640.9, "end": 642.18}, {"text": "Well, if you just take a look here.", "start": 642.5, "end": 644.06}, {"text": "See.", "start": 644.3, "end": 644.56}, {"text": "With our checking account, you can have unlimited daily transactions for a small amount of money.", "start": 644.92, "end": 648.7}, {"text": "monthly fee.", "start": 648.7, "end": 649.5}, {"text": "And our savings account has a higher interest rate.", "start": 649.72, "end": 652.38}, {"text": "But you must carry a minimum balance of $10,000.", "start": 652.56, "end": 655.48}, {"text": "I see.", "start": 656.14, "end": 656.88}, {"text": "Well, I think I'm more interested in a checking account.", "start": 657.22, "end": 660.06}, {"text": "I'd like to have easy access to my money.", "start": 660.48, "end": 662.5}, {"text": "All right, then.", "start": 663.62, "end": 664.36}, {"text": "With this checking account, you'll be issued a debit card and a checkbook.", "start": 664.54, "end": 668.24}, {"text": "Will you require overdraft protection?", "start": 668.7, "end": 670.88}, {"text": "There is an extra fee for that.", "start": 671.32, "end": 672.96}, {"text": "No, that won't be necessary.", "start": 673.24, "end": 674.48}, {"text": "In that case, I'll get you to fill out this paperwork.", "start": 675.36, "end": 678.3}, {"text": "I'll need your social insurance number and two pieces of government ID.", "start": 678.7, "end": 682.02}, {"text": "If you could just sign here and here and here, we'll be all set.", "start": 686.8800000000001, "end": 692.1}, {"text": "Would you like to make a deposit today?", "start": 692.56, "end": 694.24}, {"text": "Yes, I'd like to deposit $1 billion.", "start": 695.1800000000001, "end": 697.58}, {"text": "$1 billion.", "start": 703.1, "end": 704.4}, {"text": "Okay, so an interesting thing here.", "start": 713.48, "end": 715.36}, {"text": "Not many countries use checks.", "start": 715.82, "end": 718.34}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 718.72, "end": 719.32}, {"text": "Right?", "start": 719.66, "end": 719.82}, {"text": "The checkbook or a check.", "start": 719.98, "end": 721.06}, {"text": "Yeah, it tends to be more of an American thing, don't you think?", "start": 721.3, "end": 723.6}, {"text": "It is.", "start": 724.06, "end": 724.68}, {"text": "It is.", "start": 724.74, "end": 724.92}, {"text": "I think it is.", "start": 725.0, "end": 725.54}, {"text": "For those of you who aren't sure what a check is, it's basically a piece of paper that you just sign your name.", "start": 725.62, "end": 731.06}, {"text": "Yeah, you write the amount of money and then you sign your name, right?", "start": 731.06, "end": 735.12}, {"text": "Right, and then you give that to the person.", "start": 735.3, "end": 736.78}, {"text": "That person can take it to the bank and get money in exchange for it.", "start": 736.96, "end": 739.8}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 739.8, "end": 740.04}, {"text": "It's not very common in other countries.", "start": 740.6, "end": 742.34}, {"text": "No, but from what I know, every single American has a checkbook and uses it pretty regularly.", "start": 742.54, "end": 747.98}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 748.26, "end": 748.42}, {"text": "For example, you pay your phone bill or your electric bill.", "start": 748.56, "end": 752.32}, {"text": "You just put a check in the mailbox and it's paid.", "start": 752.5, "end": 754.8}, {"text": "And it's done.", "start": 754.96, "end": 755.22}, {"text": "It's an interesting thing.", "start": 755.76, "end": 756.88}, {"text": "Also, sometimes in other countries, people's salaries are paid through checks.", "start": 757.12, "end": 761.5}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 761.74, "end": 761.98}, {"text": "Paycheck.", "start": 762.24, "end": 762.58}, {"text": "Oh, yes.", "start": 762.82, "end": 763.56}, {"text": "I see where that word comes from.", "start": 763.76, "end": 765.32}, {"text": "Paycheck.", "start": 765.9, "end": 766.3}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 766.44, "end": 766.64}, {"text": "But for example, here in China, it's not very common, right?", "start": 767.0, "end": 769.16}, {"text": "I've never seen a check here.", "start": 769.36, "end": 770.64}, {"text": "Me neither.", "start": 770.76, "end": 771.1}, {"text": "What about in your countries?", "start": 771.3, "end": 772.36}, {"text": "We'd like to know how the banking system works.", "start": 772.36, "end": 774.72}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 774.92, "end": 775.14}, {"text": "Come to our website at englishpod.com and tell us all about it.", "start": 775.24, "end": 778.9}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 779.18, "end": 779.58}, {"text": "And you can also leave your questions and comments on our website and we'll be there to answer it.", "start": 779.72, "end": 783.36}, {"text": "Yeah, Marco and I love answering your questions.", "start": 783.36, "end": 785.36}, {"text": "So please visit us.", "start": 785.36, "end": 786.64}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 786.84, "end": 786.98}, {"text": "But until then, it's...", "start": 787.2, "end": 788.16}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 788.16, "end": 788.4}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 788.66, "end": 788.78}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 789.04, "end": 789.3}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 789.3, "end": 789.6}, {"text": "", "start": 790.04, "end": 790.04}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 790.92, "end": 791.0}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 791.0, "end": 791.02}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 791.22, "end": 791.74}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 792.54, "end": 792.82}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 793.02, "end": 793.38}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 793.54, "end": 793.64}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 793.64, "end": 794.08}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 794.08, "end": 794.1}, {"text": "", "start": 794.28, "end": 794.28}, {"text": "", "start": 794.84, "end": 794.84}, {"text": "", "start": 794.86, "end": 794.86}, {"text": "", "start": 795.36, "end": 795.36}, {"text": "", "start": 795.36, "end": 795.36}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "", "start": 796.62, "end": 796.62}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 796.62, "